{"id":800,"gn":"Pokémon Prisme","ft":["Une créature endormie sous terre. On suppose qu’il s’agit d’une Ultra-Chimère et qu’elle serait venue d’un autre monde, il y a bien longtemps.","La lumière semble être sa source d’énergie. Une créature extrêmement agressive, capable d’émettre des rayons laser au moindre prétexte.","Il semble souffrir dans sa recherche désespérée de lumière, sa source d’énergie. On pense qu’il vient d’un autre monde.","S’il ne dévore pas assez de lumière, sa source d’énergie, il accumule les impuretés. Il noircit et finit par ne plus pouvoir bouger.","La lumière est sa source d’énergie. Les impuretés que son corps a accumulées en dormant sous terre lui ont donné cette couleur noire.","Sa quête de lumière, sa source de vie, le rend violent. Il détruit tout sur son passage avec ses rayons laser."],"fv":{"27":0,"28":1,"29":2,"30":3,"33":4,"34":5},"gr":-1,"cr":255,"hc":120,"bh":0,"eg":["Inconnu"],"gw":"slow","gm":{"usum":[0,400],"sm":[0,300]},"f":{"800":{"n":"Necrozma","t":["psychic"],"s":[97,107,101,127,89,79],"h":2.4,"w":230,"a":[[232,0]],"av":["usum","sm"],"ls":[{"l":[[236,1],[234,1],[451,1],[429,1],[232,1],[93,1],[163,7],[500,13],[350,19],[400,23],[356,31],[427,37],[408,43],[475,47],[722,50],[446,53],[334,59],[378,67],[711,73]],"m":[14,63,76,86,89,92,94,104,113,115,156,157,164,168,182,207,214,216,218,237,263,280,317,332,347,360,373,374,397,399,404,416,421,430,433,444,451,473,496,523,590,684,693],"t":[173,200,257,278,282,304,324,334,351,356,393,406,414,442,446,477,502]},{"l":[[236,1],[234,1],[451,1],[429,1],[232,1],[93,1],[163,7],[500,13],[350,19],[400,23],[356,31],[427,37],[408,43],[475,47],[446,53],[334,59],[378,67],[711,73]],"m":[14,63,76,86,89,92,94,104,113,115,156,157,164,168,182,207,214,216,218,237,263,280,317,332,347,360,373,374,397,399,404,416,421,430,433,444,451,473,496,523,590,684,693]}],"lm":{"usum":0,"sm":1},"go":{"a":251,"d":195,"s":219,"m50":4163,"m51":4213,"t":["psychic"],"bd":20,"fm":["METAL_CLAW_FAST","PSYCHO_CUT_FAST","SHADOW_CL